2026-10-16: added isolated profiles, authenticated profile API, browser login with
SMS challenges, encrypted token storage and scheduled collection. coop_archive.py
now checkpoints refreshed tokens to the encrypted vault. The Phocket integration
communicates over HTTP and contains no Grocious provider implementation.
Corresponding source is available through the service's /source endpoint.

2026-10-16: added provider_archive.py from Grocious feature/multi-user,
provider_login.py and provider_session.py for separate Rema/Trumf browser login,
provider-specific encrypted sessions, receipt backfill and refresh checkpoints.
The provider archive imports the isolated job's provider_session adapter instead
of webgui. All three providers share the authenticated HTTP protocol.

2026-10-16: tolerate Coop SMS auto-submit after a validated callback, ignore empty
error containers, and report credential-free failure stages for troubleshooting.

2026-10-16: added an account-owned, in-memory manual Rema verification relay.
Only the visible reCAPTCHA frame can be viewed/clicked by its owner; no solver,
login-page capture, image persistence or new public port is introduced. Added
runtime time-zone data required by provider receipt normalization.
